>VpNac
tasmād virodhe dharmmasya niścitya gurulāghāvaṃ | yataḥ śriyas tato rājan kuru dharmmavinirṇṇayaṃ ||
>VpNpc
tasmād virodhe dharmmasya niścitya gurulāghāvaṃ | yataḥ śriyas tato rājan kuru dharmmavinirṇṇayaṃ ||
>MbhC
virodhiṣu mahīpāla niścitya gurulāghavam | na bādhā vidyate yatra taṃ dharmaṃ samudācaret || 11 gurulāghavam ājñāya dharmādharmaviniścaye | yato bhūyāṃs tato rājan kuru dharmaviniścayam || 12
>MbhS
virodhiṣu mahīpāla niścitya gurulāghavam | na bādhā vidyate yatra taṃ dharmaṃ samupācaret || 11 gurulāghavam ājñāya dharmādharmaviniścaye | yato bhūyas tato rājan_ kuru dharmaviniścayam || 12
>MbhSm
tasmād virodhe dharmasya niścitya gurulāghavam | yato bhūyas tato vidvān_ kuryād dharmavinirṇayam ||
>VpBh
tasmād virodhe dharmasya niścitya gurulāghavam | manyase gauravaṃ yatra tat kuruṣva nṛpottama || 26 ||
